                <td style={{ fontFamily: "kanit", fontSize: 12, backgroundColor: "#7a7a7aff", color: "white" }}>เน€เธฅเธเธ—เธตเนเน€เธญเธเธชเธฒเธฃ</td>
                <td style={{ fontFamily: "kanit", fontSize: 12, backgroundColor: "#7a7a7aff", color: "white" }}>เธเธทเนเธญเธเธฃเธดเธฉเธฑเธ—</td>
                <td style={{ fontFamily: "kanit", fontSize: 12, backgroundColor: "#7a7a7aff", color: "white", textAlign: "center" }}>เธเธณเธเธงเธ</td>
                <td style={{ fontFamily: "kanit", fontSize: 12, backgroundColor: "#7a7a7aff", color: "white", textAlign: "center" }}>เธขเธญเธ”เธฃเธงเธกเธชเธธเธ—เธเธด</td>
                <td style={{ fontFamily: "kanit", fontSize: 12, backgroundColor: "#7a7a7aff", color: "white", textAlign: "center" }}>เธชเธ–เธฒเธเธฐ</td>
